 mandato in terapia dal controverso terapeuta Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake cerca di indagare sul bambino silenzioso riguardo a ciò che ha visto, ma ottiene ulteriori dettagli sulle dinamiche familiari dei Warden dalla sorella adolescente di Tim, Sylvie. Trascorrendo più tempo con i fratelli, Jake scopre che il matrimonio dei Warden non era così perfetto come sembrava e scopre altri nuovi dettagli che potrebbero aiutare a risolvere il crimine.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"A Savage Crime. A Silent Witness.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1994-10-28","status":"Released","rating":5.3,"ratingCount":81,"genres":["Dramma","Thriller","Mistero"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"101m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":3037,"name":"Richard Dreyfuss","role":"Dr. Jake Rainer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q2BPu6zWwFtnzQfpl4fgbKqURXM.jpg"},{"id":2713,"name":"Linda Hamilton","role":"Karen Rainer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7FNn9Z5xkRS9EFbGL2tpmpph9xV.jpg"},{"id":12074,"name":"John Lithgow","role":"Dr. Rene Harlinger","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ajfuBSm1HuVqFJlbTmAlza62Xxr.jpg"},{"id":22131,"name":"J.T. Walsh","role":"Sheriff Mitch Rivers","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mBa1UnbbKryNtQKT3VOnzER1HiQ.jpg"},{"id":1037237,"name":"Ben Faulkner","role":"Tim Warden","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/duEDrL9HCll4WAg48hVgKfYbqb5.jpg"},{"id":882,"name":"Liv Tyler","role":"Sylvie Warden","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rC6f9NoDN9l2tMgiEocIvnJi2tW.jpg"},{"id":42376,"name":"Zahn McClarnon","role":"Deputy Bear","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/54M2t1gziirkDdvj4SxAl6dXaVO.jpg"},{"id":1267257,"name":"Brandon Stouffer","role":"Halloween Kid #1"},{"id":1267258,"name":"Treva Moniik King","role":"Halloween Kid #2"},{"id":1267259,"name":"John McGee Jr.","role":"Deputy"},{"id":1267260,"name":"Ron Tucker","role":"Forensic Detective"},{"id":1267261,"name":"Catherine Shaffner","role":"Martha"},{"id":1267262,"name":"Heather M. Bomba","role":"Twin #1"},{"id":1267263,"name":"Marianne E. Bomba","role":"Twin #2"},{"id":58967,"name":"Jane Beard","role":"Carol Simmons"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Rosso d'autunno","overview":"Dopo aver assistito al duplice omicidio dei suoi genitori, il giovane autistico Tim Warden viene mandato in terapia dal controverso terapeuta Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake cerca di indagare sul bambino silenzioso riguardo a ciò che ha visto, ma ottiene ulteriori dettagli sulle dinamiche familiari dei Warden dalla sorella adolescente di Tim, Sylvie. Trascorrendo più tempo con i fratelli, Jake scopre che il matrimonio dei Warden non era così perfetto come sembrava e scopre altri nuovi dettagli che potrebbero aiutare a risolvere il crimine."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Having seen the double murder of his parents, autistic youth Tim Warden is sent to therapy with controversial therapist Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake tries to probe the silent child about what he saw, but he gets more details about the Wardens' household dynamics from Tim's teenage sister, Sylvie. As he spends more time with the siblings, Jake learns that the Wardens' marriage was not as perfect as it seemed, and he uncovers other new details that might help solve the crime.","tagline":"A Savage Crime. A Silent Witness."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gY7Hl8OTadyD51tQzrEUeQgGBLx.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4XpTvJGz804zAcmiWpfovnEfYdF.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":39473,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gY7Hl8OTadyD51tQzrEUeQgGBLx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.or